id: pm-review-classifier-timing
title: Investigate classifier timing gate sensitivity to shared-host scheduling
description: "The unchanged bot-classification regression exceeded its 50 ms wall-clock limit during the full closeout-verification release run (63.60046 ms), while the isolated same-source test passed. No classifier implementation, timing limit or coverage floor changed. Investigate repeatability and scheduling effects separately from closeout verification."
